    "oracles": [
      "validator independently derives config/** exact41 and all manual semantic profiles without importing generator",
      "current-main pins enforce authoritative 496 union from eight inventories and merged SCF-B-0126 records, with exact target zero overlap",
      "strict JSON duplicate-key and input freshness guards including Wave1/37/50 and main inventory inputs",
      "archive ls-tree regular blob/path, MANIFEST, ledger, semantic coverage, and static read guards",
      "selfcheck covers 64 ordered negatives for category/evidence invariants, exact JSON types, null/nonobject fail-close, scope selection axes, reachable guards, generator profile drift, Binding closure, and archive mode/mismatch"
